{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AeKg2t5hqsb6Eguo1dZJxu","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Pixel Engine API (v0.46.0)\n2\t\n3\tEvery export of `pixel-engine.js` (493 names), generated from the engine's TypeScript at build 2026-11-02 f75d4a6. Signatures are the source declarations; descriptions are their doc comments. Read GUIDE.md first: it says how the pieces fit; come here for exact names and parameters (search this file, don't read it whole).\n4\t\n5\t## Sections\n6\t\n7\t1. Engine and games: `ADAPTIVE_ASPECT`, `AspectMode`, `BUILTIN_MODELS`, `chunkyResolution`, `clearScene`, `computeFraming`, `countObjects`, `DebugAction`, `DebugKeyChanges`, `DebugKeyMap`, `DebugKeysOption`, `DEFAULT_DEBUG_KEYS`, `disposeObject`, `Engine`, `ENGINE_VERSION`, `EngineOptions`, `FPS_OPTIONS`, `FrameLimiter`, `frameView`, `Framing`, `Game`, `GameContext`, `HeadlessOptions`, `LoadingScreen`, `loadSettings`, `normalizeSettings`, `optionsFromUrl`, `PIXEL_SIZES`, `PlayerSettings`, `QUALITY`, `QUALITY_LEVELS`, `QUALITY_OPTIONS`, `QualityLevel`, `QualityOption`, `QualitySettings`, `rebindDebugKeys`, `Resolution`, `RESOLUTIONS`, `resolveDebugKeys`, `Settings`, `SettingsHost`, `SettingsPanel`, `storeSettings`, `urlSettings`, `Viewport`, `withUrlOptions`\n8\t2. Camera: `CAMERA_PRESETS`, `CameraConfig`, `CameraPreset`, `CameraRig`, `CameraRigState`, `createCameraRig`, `FirstPersonRig`, `FreeRig`, `OrthoRig`, `ThirdPersonRig`\n9\t3. Rendering, looks and filters: `AMOUNT`, `applyFilter`, `applyFilters`, `BackendName`, `CapturedFrame`, `clampParam`, `cloneLook`, `DEFAULT_EDGES`, `DEFAULT_PIXEL`, `defaultLook`, `defaultParams`, `EdgeSettings`, `FILTER_IDS`, `FILTER_PRESETS`, `FilterContext`, `FilterDef`, `FilterGroup`, `filterOrder`, `FilterParam`, `filterParams`, `filterPresetOf`, `filterPresets`, `FILTERS`, `FilterSpace`, `getFilter`, `LayerLook`, `Look`, `LOOK_ALIASES`, `LOOK_PRESETS`, `LOOK_TARGET_LABELS`, `LOOK_TARGETS`, `LookFilter`, `lookFilters`