{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JEDQ9J8XXGb6s4HjmVSuRH","type":"tool_result","content":"```ts\nconst DEFAULT_TOUCH_BUTTONS: readonly TouchButton[]\n```\n\nDefault buttons for PlatformerCharacter (see character/controls.ts KEYMAP).\n\n### GAMEPAD_BUTTONS\n\n```ts\nconst GAMEPAD_BUTTONS: Readonly<Record<number, string>>\n```\n\nStandard-mapping gamepad buttons → the key codes they press (see character/controls.ts\nKEYMAP). Change `input.gamepadButtons` to remap. Indices follow the W3C \"standard\" layout:\n0 A · 1 B · 2 X · 3 Y · 4 LB · 5 RB · 6 LT · 7 RT · 8 Back · 9 Start · 12–15 d-pad.\n\n### interface GamepadLike\n\nThe parts of the Gamepad API that Input reads (tests can pass plain objects).\n\n- `readonly connected?: boolean`\n- `readonly mapping?: string`\n- `readonly axes: readonly number[]`\n- `readonly buttons: readonly { readonly pressed: boolean; readonly value?: number }[]`\n\n### class Input\n\nKeyboard + pointer + gamepad input.\n- Keys: held state, per-frame presses (`wasPressed`) and queued presses for fixed-step\n358:### interface PlayerSettings\n460:### class Settings\n492:### class SettingsPanel\n577:### class CameraRig\n666:### class ThirdPersonRig\n1281:### interface LightRequestOptions\n1417:### class Breakables\n1476:### class CharacterController\n1777:### class Physics\n1834:### class Ragdoll\n1851:### interface RagdollOptions\n2140:### KEYMAP\n2178:### class PlatformerCharacter\n2231:### readMoveInput()\n2462:### class AudioManager\n2558:### renderSound()\n2582:### interface Song\n2596:### interface SoundDef\n2634:### interface Voice\n2645:### interface VoiceSettings\n2658:### type Wave\n2762:### class Hud\n3022:### loadPack()\n3037:### loadPackIndex()\n3273:### parsePack()\n3366:### setAssetReader()\n3634:### gaitClip()\n3648:### interface GaitSpec\n3854:### HERO_CLIPS\n3876:### HERO_RIG\n3911:### applySky()\n3927:### class BehaviorTree\n4127:### class Decals\n4323:### groundFog()\n4486:### class NavGrid\n4733:### skyAt()\n4881:### class Timeline","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a882869-9e92-4155-a3b0-121d8fdc660c","uuid":"04b0e52f-b1cd-41eb-b6dd-1ef6a402b861","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:21:32.707Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"```ts\nconst DEFAULT_TOUCH_BUTTONS: readonly TouchButton[]\n```\n\nDefault buttons for PlatformerCharacter (see character/controls.ts KEYMAP).\n\n### GAMEPAD_BUTTONS\n\n```ts\nconst GAMEPAD_BUTTONS: Readonly<Record<number, string>>\n```\n\nStandard-mapping gamepad buttons → the key codes they press (see character/controls.ts\nKEYMAP). Change `input.gamepadButtons` to remap. Indices follow the W3C \"standard\" layout:\n0 A · 1 B · 2 X · 3 Y · 4 LB · 5 RB · 6 LT · 7 RT · 8 Back · 9 Start · 12–15 d-pad.\n\n### interface GamepadLike\n\nThe parts of the Gamepad API that Input reads (tests can pass plain objects).\n\n- `readonly connected?: boolean`\n- `readonly mapping?: string`\n- `readonly axes: readonly number[]`\n- `readonly buttons: readonly { readonly pressed: boolean; readonly value?: number }[]`\n\n### class Input\n\nKeyboard + pointer + gamepad input.\n- Keys: held state, per-frame presses (`wasPressed`) and queued presses for fixed-step\n358:### interface PlayerSettings\n460:### class Settings\n492:### class SettingsPanel\n577:### class CameraRig\n666:### class ThirdPersonRig\n1281:### interface LightRequestOptions\n1417:### class Breakables\n1476:### class CharacterController\n1777:### class Physics\n1834:### class Ragdoll\n1851:### interface RagdollOptions\n2140:### KEYMAP\n2178:### class PlatformerCharacter\n2231:### readMoveInput()\n2462:### class AudioManager\n2558:### renderSound()\n2582:### interface Song\n2596:### interface SoundDef\n2634:### interface Voice\n2645:### interface VoiceSettings\n2658:### type Wave\n2762:### class Hud\n3022:### loadPack()\n3037:### loadPackIndex()\n3273:### parsePack()\n3366:### setAssetReader()\n3634:### gaitClip()\n3648:### interface GaitSpec\n3854:### HERO_CLIPS\n3876:### HERO_RIG\n3911:### applySky()\n3927:### class BehaviorTree\n4127:### class Decals\n4323:### groundFog()\n4486:### class NavGrid\n4733:### skyAt()\n4881:### class Timeline","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JEDQ9J8XXGb6s4HjmVSuRH","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
