{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SXRJbJj7sSJUwEjEsASMCp","type":"tool_result","content":"attract                            10\n10 seconds                         1\nDEV MODE                           2\nlive sliders                       2\nRESET                              2\nCONTROLLER OR KEYBOARD REQUIRED    2\ntouch: false                       2\nXbox                               4\nPlayStation                        2\ngibberish                          5\n0.10                               6\nfile://                            5\nesbuild                            2\nAbout/Credits                      1\nadded on import                    2\nharness                            5\nshared-world                       4\nBroadcastChannel                   2\nWebRTC                             3\nplaythrough                        2\nN passed, M failed                 1\nsubagents                          1\nno files                           1\ngetGamepads                        2\nPhone profile                      1\nAnalyserNode                       2\n1920×1080                         2\nNo TODOs                           1\nquality: .high.                    4\ndocs/CONTENT.md                    3\nSource Information                 3\nTesting Feedback                   1\nEngine Feedback                    1\nPrompt Feedback                    2\nhub:webgpu                         1\nNever edit                         1\n| Source, genre, perspective | §1 |\n| Title (brainstorm, RNG, riff on the source) | Builder, per TASK.md; `src/config.js`; title layout auto-fits (§11) |\n| Research | Plan and kit docs are enough; report what you did |\n| Single HTML package and dev subfolder | §14 |\n| Engine kit, kept as it ships | §14 |\n| Art: native style base, new source-feel assets, library for generic props | §8 |\n| Animation: native system base, new animations | §9 |\n| Audio: code only, gibberish voices, music 10% de